# --- Phase 3 (EL Tariff Opti) -------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw experiment data MUST be versioned: re-include per-instance part files, which the generic
# packaging rule "parts/" above would otherwise exclude.
!results/**/parts/
!results/**/parts/*.csv
